{"id":"b2ce8b00b90479d8","group":"18","path":"18/18-df-unbounded-minimization.md","title":"无界最小化的部分函数","display":"df-unbounded-minimization — 无界最小化的部分函数","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-df-unbounded-minimization","aliases":["18-df-unbounded-minimization","18-df-007"],"display":"df-unbounded-minimization — 无界最小化的部分函数","depends_on":["[[18-df-ordinal]]"],"source_title":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity","source_edition":"Springer, 2009; ISBN 978-3-540-69318-5","source_section":"2.2.7 (comparison only)","source_printed_pages":"15","source_pdf_pages":"26","source_correspondence":"supplement-unbounded-minimization","source_statement_status":"checked-2026-10-13","content_revision":"2026-10-14","content_review_scope":"local formal-language and dependency review; no proof-assistant verification; no new source-page check"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-df-unbounded-minimization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-df-unbounded-minimization</span><span>18-df-007</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-unbounded-minimization — 无界最小化的部分函数"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cf95026e035bcb2b\" href=\"?note=cf95026e035bcb2b\" title=\"18-df-ordinal\">18-df-ordinal</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_title","html":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Springer, 2009; ISBN 978-3-540-69318-5"},{"key":"source_section","html":"2.2.7 (comparison only)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"15"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"26"},{"key":"source_correspondence","html":"supplement-unbounded-minimization"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-2026-10-13"},{"key":"content_revision","html":"2026-10-14"},{"key":"content_review_scope","html":"local formal-language and dependency review; no proof-assistant verification; no new source-page check"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq\\mathbb N^{n+1}\">\\(R\\subseteq\\mathbb N^{n+1}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(y,\\vec x)=\\langle y\\rangle{}^\\frown\\vec x\">\\((y,\\vec x)=\\langle y\\rangle{}^\\frown\\vec x\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu R\">\\(\\mu R\\)</span> 是下式引入的部分函数；不在本节点假定它本原递归。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\omega\">\\(\\mathbb N=\\omega\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"cf95026e035bcb2b\" href=\"?note=cf95026e035bcb2b\" title=\"18-df-ordinal\">18-df-ordinal</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"D_R\\coloneqq\\{\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^n:\\exists y\\in\\mathbb N\\;(y,\\vec x)\\in R\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[D_R\\coloneqq\\{\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^n:\\exists y\\in\\mathbb N\\;(y,\\vec x)\\in R\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mu R\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\vec x,y\\rangle\\in\\mathbb N^n\\times\\mathbb N:\n(y,\\vec x)\\in R\\land\\forall u&lt;y\\;(u,\\vec x)\\notin R\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mu R\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\vec x,y\\rangle\\in\\mathbb N^n\\times\\mathbb N:\n(y,\\vec x)\\in R\\land\\forall u&lt;y\\;(u,\\vec x)\\notin R\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mu R:D_R\\to\\mathbb N,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{dom}(\\mu R)=D_R.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mu R:D_R\\to\\mathbb N,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{dom}(\\mu R)=D_R.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是保留既有笔记对象的辅助定义，不是原书 Exercise 2.2.7 的有界搜索。原稿对空见证集直接写 min，现由部分函数图明确其定义域；每个非空自然数见证集有唯一最小元。有界版本见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"49cfb3511a1d1124\" href=\"?note=49cfb3511a1d1124\" title=\"18-df-bounded-search\">18-df-bounded-search</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"cf95026e035bcb2b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"cf95026e035bcb2b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbb N=\\omega$ 取 [[18-df-ordinal]]。","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-bounded-search","status":"resolved","id":"49cfb3511a1d1124","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"这是保留既有笔记对象的辅助定义，不是原书 Exercise 2.2.7 的有界搜索。原稿对空见证集直接写 min，现由部分函数图明确其定义域；每个非空自然数见证集有唯一最小元。有界版本见 [[18-df-bounded-search]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq\\mathbb N^{n+1}","display":false},{"tex":"(y,\\vec x)=\\langle y\\rangle{}^\\frown\\vec x","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"D_R\\coloneqq\\{\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^n:\\exists y\\in\\mathbb N\\;(y,\\vec x)\\in R\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mu R\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\vec x,y\\rangle\\in\\mathbb N^n\\times\\mathbb N:\n(y,\\vec x)\\in R\\land\\forall u<y\\;(u,\\vec x)\\notin R\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mu R:D_R\\to\\mathbb N,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{dom}(\\mu R)=D_R.","display":true}],"bytes":1623,"backlinks":[{"id":"e40f6292323bbb0b","anchor":"ref-35","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./18-df-unbounded-minimization]]"},{"id":"e29d1100705cdb23","anchor":"ref-109","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-unbounded-minimization]]"}],"outgoing":["cf95026e035bcb2b","49cfb3511a1d1124"]}